# Olympicenyl radical chain: two C19H11 units per cell, linked by single C-C bonds,
# alternately flipped (2 rings on top / 3 rings on top). Period 14 half-hexagons.
# A linked pair of rings is 3 columns and 1 row apart (one empty hexagon between them);
# rows alternate the parity of the columns (row 0 even, row 1 odd, row 2 even, row 3 odd).
..O.O.........
.O.O.O........
........O.O.O.
.........O.O..
